// The navigation stdlib is self-hosted: every nav ships as an ordinary Tao declaration bound to a
// runtime implementation through the same public mechanism a third-party package uses. Copy a
// declaration, rename it, and swap the implementation without changing the compiler or language.
// Anything an app can present. `ui` and `nav` are closed roles; the union is the capability.
public type Presentable is ui | nav

// A nav declares its configuration contract in Tao. Property names are ordinary capitalized
// identifiers, and `@key` declares the common shape accepted by every keyed item.
//
// `implement inject <protocol>` binds the declaration to a TS value satisfying the published,
// versioned TR.NavKind protocol. The binding attaches to a package-level declaration rather than
// defining app semantics inline.
//
// TR.NavKind contract (conformance suite: TR.testNavKind(kind, profile)):
// - configure(declaration, config) returns an immutable descriptor whose identity is the declaring
//   Tao declaration plus normalized configuration — never a name lookup and never serialized
// - mount(descriptor) creates independent state per occurrence in an app mount
// - render(mount, taoProps) keeps every state-bearing covered occurrence mounted, hidden, and out
//   of accessibility; the runtime wraps every kind in the same nav-owned overlay lane
// - present, dismiss, back, reset, and canGoBack are the only content-lifecycle verbs; dismiss and
//   back report whether they consumed the request and are root-safe
// - the profile fixes kind-specific meaning: stack pushes/pops fresh occurrences; slot replaces and
//   restores Initial; selection activates one keyed child without creating new content
// - occurrence identity is monotonic within one mount; a kind never drives native navigation itself
// Common conformance is shared, while stack, slot, and selection each add their profile assertions.
public nav StackNav {
   Initial ui // the argument-free entry seeded at mount; nav-in-stack entries stay deferred

   implement inject nav ```ts
      return TR.NavKind.Stack()
   ```
}

public nav SlotNav {
   Initial Presentable

   implement inject nav ```ts
      return TR.NavKind.Slot()
   ```
}

public nav SelectionNav {
   Initial key
   Display text
   @key {
      Label text
      Content Presentable
   }

   implement inject nav ```ts
      return TR.NavKind.Selection()
   ```
}
